乃使人復召趙王。王來，未到。孝惠帝慈仁，知太后怒，自迎趙王霸上，與入宮，自挾與趙王起居飲食。太后欲殺之，不得閒。孝惠元年十二月，帝晨出射。趙王少，不能蚤起。太后聞其獨居，使人持酖飲之。犁明，孝惠還，趙王已死。於是乃徙淮陽王友為趙王。夏，詔賜酈侯父追謚為令武侯。太后遂斷戚夫人手足，去眼，煇耳，飲瘖藥，使居廁中，命曰「人彘」。居數日，乃召孝惠帝觀人彘。孝惠見，問，乃知其戚夫人，乃大哭，因病，歲餘不能起。使人請太后曰：「此非人所為。臣為太后子，終不能治天下。」孝惠以此日飲為淫樂，不聽政，故有病也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m004-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"呂后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000717","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m004-0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"戚夫人","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000819","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m004-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"趙王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000820","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m004-0018","start":18,"end":21,"surface":"戚夫人","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000819","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m004-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"趙王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000820","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m004-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"趙相","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000826","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m004-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"周昌","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000826","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m004-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"高帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000662","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m004-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"趙王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000820","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m004-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"趙王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000820","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m004-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000717","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m004-00