l_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m004-0314","start":314,"end":316,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000717","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m004-0327","start":327,"end":329,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000717","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m004-0339","start":339,"end":341,"surface":"孝惠","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000713","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou","book_id":"b-shiji-009","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-009-lvhou"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:p007","text":"太后稱制，議欲立諸呂為王，問右丞相王陵。王陵曰：「高帝刑白馬盟曰『非劉氏而王，天下共擊之』。今王呂氏，非約也。」太后不說。問左丞相陳平、絳侯周勃。勃等對曰：「高帝定天下，王子弟，今太后稱制，王昆弟諸呂，無所不可。」太后喜，罷朝。王陵讓陳平、絳侯曰：「始與高帝啑血盟，諸君不在邪？今高帝崩，太后女主，欲王呂氏，諸君從欲阿意背約，何面目見高帝地下？」陳平、絳侯曰：「於今面折廷爭，臣不如君；夫全社稷，定劉氏之後，君亦不如臣。」王陵無以應之。十一月，太后欲廢王陵，乃拜為帝太傅，奪之相權。王陵遂病免歸。乃以左丞相平為右丞相，以辟陽侯審食其為左丞相。左丞相不治事，令監宮中，如郎中令。食其故得幸太后，常用事，公卿皆因而決事。乃追尊酈侯父為悼武王，欲以王諸呂為漸。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m007-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000717","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m007-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"王陵","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000770","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m007-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"王陵","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000770","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m007-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"高帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000662","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m007-0034","start":34,"end":36,"surface":"劉氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體或稱號仍待逐處覆核，不補熟知名字。"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m007-0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"呂氏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體或稱號仍待逐處覆核，不補熟知名字。"},{"id":"c-shiji-009-lvhou:m007-0056","start":5